    "detailed_description": "TransMemory is a single-player, first-person exploration horror game.<br>While being chased by a doll, you must search for items and try to escape from the basement.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>You wake up in a dimly lit basement.<br>You have no memory of who you are or why you are here.<br>You hear footsteps and turn around to find a creepy doll standing there.<br>Can you escape from the basement where this creepy doll roams?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138360/extras/924e37ad066aba4c8afcfa99ae739c74.poster.avif?t=1728178951\" width=548 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138360/extras/924e37ad066aba4c8afcfa99ae739c74.webm?t=1728178951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138360/extras/924e37ad066aba4c8afcfa99ae739c74.mp4?t=1728178951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2>WASD - Move<br>SHIFT - Run<br>CTRL - Crouch<br>LEFT CLICK - Interact<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time</h2>30~60 minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video distribution</h2>You may distribute your videos without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.<br>Monetization is only possible when you use the functions provided by the video distribution site.<br>We would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of the video or streaming video, or include a link to the Steam page in the summary section.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
